{"title":"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many odd and even divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07f49d7ea42b17825ed4add0802e1ead746114a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^6 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" /> are there?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We start by factoring the expression.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/5/0c5cb0da5fc5218f6ec0a0284011ec26f8e73c7a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(5^3 + 1)(5^3 - 1)\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/c/5cc041b21790a691cef87e07e2d90cd3ba01028c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[126 \\cdot 124\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c845759f427d50ff1a24f2e0b0a323d62037f38.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 \\cdot 63 \\cdot 4 \\cdot 31\\]\" width=\"92\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/6/aa6c327c664c2c9845ed7613858ea553c344dcbd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^3 \\cdot 3^2 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 31\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />\nIf a divisor is even, then the exponent of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of the divisor’s <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prime_factorization\" title=\"Prime factorization\">prime factorization</a> is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/d/c8da250d77c20c2b8cc993fd8c1c8aa1f6391bd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 = \\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"23\" /> even divisors.\n</p><p>If a divisor is odd, then the exponent of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of the divisor’s prime factorization is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/95385ca4a2f32059af29f6b3fd0296e4998cbba1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 = \\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"23\" /> odd divisors.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO\">2004 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017203914\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 91/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1007/2097152 bytes\